### URL: https://www-dev.springfield.moz.works/get/

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Ky shkarkim { -brand-name-firefox }-i nga { $partner } s’mund të kihet në gjuhën tuaj. Mundeni ende të shkarkoni { -brand-name-firefox }-in duke përdorur butonin më poshtë.
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Ky shkarkim { -brand-name-firefox }-i nga { $partner } s’mund të kihet në pajisjen tuaj. Mundeni ende të shkarkoni { -brand-name-firefox }-in duke përdorur butonin më poshtë.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = E përdorni tashmë { -brand-name-firefox }-in. Vazhdoni te firefox.com, që të shihni ç’ka të re.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Vazhdoni te firefox.com
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-link-visit = Vizitoni { $partner }
